Package: rio.wmel.longterm
Title: Long-term effectiveness of Wolbachia introgression in preventing dengue
    in Rio de Janeiro
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Paloma M.", "Cárcamo", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "paloma.carcamo@yale.edu"),
    person("Albert I.", "Ko", role = "aut"))
Description: Analysis code accompanying the manuscript on the long-term
    effectiveness of wMel Wolbachia introgression against dengue in Rio de
    Janeiro, Brazil (2017-2024). Contains the empirical INLA spatiotemporal
    models and the temperature-dependent SEIR-SEI mechanistic simulations. This
    is a research compendium, not an installable package; see README.md.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
